{"uid":"92494cf8ba6b7bea","name":"test_the_suite_never_reads_the_ambient_config_mount_at_a_boundary","fullName":"tests.test_amendment_status_load_time#test_the_suite_never_reads_the_ambient_config_mount_at_a_boundary","historyId":"8bc2e68692b74c57f484957e3e2c5035","time":{"start":1791946076406,"stop":1791946076407,"duration":1},"description":"GH #209 defect 6 turned `loop.CONFIG_DIR` into a per-worker-pass and\n    per-review-step read, so this suite's own ambient exposure to it matters\n    now in a way it did not when the read happened once per episode: inside\n    a self-dev container that path is the operator's REAL `:ro` amendments\n    mount, and fixture plans overwhelmingly use task id `001`, so a live\n    `--status` ruling could rewrite an unrelated test's `tasks.json` from a\n    `_step_worker` drive.\n\n    Deliberately takes no `monkeypatch` of its own: the property under test\n    is that `tests/conftest.py::_scrub_notifier_env_in_process` isolates the\n    `loop` binding too, alongside the `config` one it already isolated for\n    the ambient `job.yaml` leak (v0.20.2 requirement B.4). Same guard shape\n    as `tests/test_in_process_home_isolation_guard.py`: it fails the moment\n    that isolation is removed, however green every other node stays.","descriptionHtml":"<p>GH #209 defect 6 turned <code>loop.CONFIG_DIR</code> into a per-worker-pass and<br />\nper-review-step read, so this suite's own ambient exposure to it matters<br />\nnow in a way it did not when the read happened once per episode: inside<br />\na self-dev container that path is the operator's REAL <code>:ro</code> amendments<br />\nmount, and fixture plans overwhelmingly use task id <code>001</code>, so a live<br />\n<code>--status</code> ruling could rewrite an unrelated test's <code>tasks.json</code> from a<br />\n<code>_step_worker</code> drive.</p>\n<pre><code>Deliberately takes no `monkeypatch` of its own: the property under test\nis that `tests/conftest.py::_scrub_notifier_env_in_process` isolates the\n`loop` binding too, alongside the `config` one it already isolated for\nthe ambient `job.yaml` leak (v0.20.2 requirement B.4). Same guard shape\nas `tests/test_in_process_home_isolation_guard.py`: it fails the moment\nthat isolation is removed, however green every other node stays.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791946076393,"stop":1791946076398,"duration":5},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791946076393,"stop":1791946076393,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791946076399,"stop":1791946076405,"duration":6},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791946076399,"stop":1791946076399,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_undo_instant_sleep_patches","time":{"start":1791946076405,"stop":1791946076405,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_wait_out_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791946076405,"stop":1791946076405,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"paramete